            "review_title": "Review at Station Sports Bar & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "WayfarerRBS S\nKathmandu, Nepal113 contributions\n0\nPerfect place to enjoy your evening\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nStation Live Music & Sports Bar in Saigon is a vibrant spot for those who love a mix of live entertainment and sports. The venue offers an electric atmosphere with live music performances featuring talented local and international bands. Its well-placed screens make it easy to catch your favorite sports games without missing a beat. The menu offers a good selection of drinks and pub-style food, all reasonably priced. The friendly staff and lively crowd make it a great place to unwind with friends. Perfect for music lovers and sports enthusiasts alike!\nRead more\nWritten December 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
