            "review_text": "Buddy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nCool!!!\nSep 2024 • Friends\nThe food here is delicious and satisfies me. I enjoyed it with a cold cocktail and listened to the rock band, which gave me an extremely memorable experience.\n\nThe sports space is lively with many large LED screens.\n\nIt suits everyone, especially those who love sports and Rock music.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 15, 2024",
