            "review_text": "Justyn S\nCootamundra, Australia86 contributions\n1\nVery poor food.\nJul 2024 • Family\nThe place looks great from the front but that’s where it ends. The staff told us about happy hour, buy two get one free, well this wasn’t anywhere where on our bill, we had three drinkers and they didn’t discount any beer. The food was ordered and we asked for cheesy garlic bread to start, this didn’t come out until we asked twice, along with the fries, mind you at the end of our main meals. We ordered the platters, two had steak, the steak was sent out cold and rare, we were not asked how we liked it cooked at the start of the order, we sent both steaks back, when they returned they had been dropped into the deep fryer and were tough like leather, one of the other dishes ordered was lamb chops, the dish was horrible with half a chop and a full chop one plate, the vegetables were not cooked. After some discussion with the so called manager it was determined that we only would pay half for the lamb plate. We could recommend this place, sorry.\nRead more\nWritten July 10, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
