            "review_text": "Jet01771691375\n6 contributions\n0\nWife’s bday celebration and positive vibes here !\nDec 2023 • Family\nIt was a beautiful place with great ambience got to celebrate by wife’s bday here. The staff here were very friendly and suggestive, food\nWas amazing and tasty just how we wanted, service was fast would over all rate this place a 5🌟 rating.\n\nThe best part is got to surprise my wife here for her bday would love and thank for the below mention not 😬 people who really went out of the box for organising a beautiful memorial setup for my wife to up-bring her beautiful start of her day.\n\nLam\nHuy\nTriue\nTam\nBao\nHakan(manager)\n\nThank you team great hospitality and keep up the good work you guys rock and have a long way to go. Keep creating such beautiful memories for People. Cheers !\n\nWarm regards,\n\nPranav Deepak\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 23, 2024",
