            "review_text": "SingaSomers\nSingapore, Singapore62 contributions\n0\nOur only negative experience in HCMC\nOct 2023 • Family\nFairly standard sports bar - big screens, pool table etc. Not a bad place for a cold drink. There’s a sign at the front advertising a happy hour deal. It says “buy two then get one free”. When you get the bill this deal changes somewhat. It somehow became “buy 3 then get one free”. \n\nWe tried our best to explain the difference, but for the sake of a few dollars it simply wasn’t worth it. A bit like this bar, really. \n\nCannot recommend.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2023",
